{"id":"01b7b9d9615ddaa5","group":"73","path":"73/73-df-language-pumping-length.md","title":"Canonical Pumping Length of a Regular Language","display":"df-regular-pumping-length — Canonical Pumping Length of a Regular Language","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Automata Theory, Languages and Computation (Hopcroft, Ullman)","book_abbrev":"73","label":"73-df-language-pumping-length","aliases":["73-df-language-pumping-length","73-df-regular-pumping-length"],"display":"df-regular-pumping-length — Canonical Pumping Length of a Regular Language","depends_on":["[[73-df-dfa-language-semantics]]","[[73-df-finite-automaton-language-class]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Automata Theory, Languages and Computation (Hopcroft, Ullman)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"73"},{"key":"label","html":"73-df-language-pumping-length"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>73-df-language-pumping-length</span><span>73-df-regular-pumping-length</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-regular-pumping-length — Canonical Pumping Length of a Regular Language"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"3b7a967565c86f39\" href=\"?note=3b7a967565c86f39\" title=\"73-df-dfa-language-semantics\">73-df-dfa-language-semantics</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"c284ffb568a496fd\" href=\"?note=c284ffb568a496fd\" title=\"73-df-finite-automaton-language-class\">73-df-finite-automaton-language-class</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma\">\\(\\Sigma\\)</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)\">\\(\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\\in\\mathsf{REG}_{\\Sigma}\">\\(L\\in\\mathsf{REG}_{\\Sigma}\\)</span>，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"c284ffb568a496fd\" href=\"?note=c284ffb568a496fd\" title=\"73-df-finite-automaton-language-class\">73-df-finite-automaton-language-class</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{DFA}_{\\Sigma}\">\\(\\mathsf{DFA}_{\\Sigma}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L(M)\">\\(L(M)\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"3b7a967565c86f39\" href=\"?note=3b7a967565c86f39\" title=\"73-df-dfa-language-semantics\">73-df-dfa-language-semantics</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p_{\\mathsf{reg}}\">\\(p_{\\mathsf{reg}}\\)</span> 的定义域为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{REG}_{\\Sigma}\">\\(\\mathsf{REG}_{\\Sigma}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}regular\\text{-}pumping\\text{-}length}\\vdash\np_{\\mathsf{reg}}(L)\\coloneqq\n\\min\\Bigl\\{n\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}:\\exists Q,\\delta,q_0,F\\;\n\\bigl((Q,\\Sigma,\\delta,q_0,F)\\in\\mathsf{DFA}_{\\Sigma}\n\\land L=L((Q,\\Sigma,\\delta,q_0,F))\\land |Q|=n\\bigr)\\Bigr\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}regular\\text{-}pumping\\text{-}length}\\vdash\np_{\\mathsf{reg}}(L)\\coloneqq\n\\min\\Bigl\\{n\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}:\\exists Q,\\delta,q_0,F\\;\n\\bigl((Q,\\Sigma,\\delta,q_0,F)\\in\\mathsf{DFA}_{\\Sigma}\n\\land L=L((Q,\\Sigma,\\delta,q_0,F))\\land |Q|=n\\bigr)\\Bigr\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>候选集合由正则性保证非空，并包含正自然数；它的最小值仍是识别该语言所需的最少状态数，而非所有可能泵长度中的最小值。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-dfa-language-semantics","status":"resolved","id":"3b7a967565c86f39","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-dfa-language-semantics]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-finite-automaton-language-class","status":"resolved","id":"c284ffb568a496fd","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-finite-automaton-language-class]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-finite-automaton-language-class","status":"resolved","id":"c284ffb568a496fd","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"固定 $\\Sigma$ 满足 $\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)$；$L\\in\\mathsf{REG}_{\\Sigma}$，见 [[73-df-finite-automaton-language-class]]。","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-dfa-language-semantics","status":"resolved","id":"3b7a967565c86f39","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathsf{DFA}_{\\Sigma}$ 与 $L(M)$ 见 [[73-df-dfa-language-semantics]]；$p_{\\mathsf{reg}}$ 的定义域为 $\\mathsf{REG}_{\\Sigma}$。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)","display":false},{"tex":"L\\in\\mathsf{REG}_{\\Sigma}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{DFA}_{\\Sigma}","display":false},{"tex":"L(M)","display":false},{"tex":"p_{\\mathsf{reg}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{REG}_{\\Sigma}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}regular\\text{-}pumping\\text{-}length}\\vdash\np_{\\mathsf{reg}}(L)\\coloneqq\n\\min\\Bigl\\{n\\in\\mathbb N_{>0}:\\exists Q,\\delta,q_0,F\\;\n\\bigl((Q,\\Sigma,\\delta,q_0,F)\\in\\mathsf{DFA}_{\\Sigma}\n\\land L=L((Q,\\Sigma,\\delta,q_0,F))\\land |Q|=n\\bigr)\\Bigr\\}","display":true}],"bytes":1242,"backlinks":[{"id":"e48ecbf40a3c92b6","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$p_{\\mathsf{reg}}(L)$ (canonical pumping length, see [[73-df-language-pumping-length]])"},{"id":"ce1461d3e7bc342b","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$p_{\\mathsf{reg}}(L)$ (minimum DFA state count f